## (d) equation-of-state rule H^2 = (rho+p)/(1+cs2) on mixtures (kappa/3 = 1)
  estimator - S^2/sum(1+w)^2 rho = 0 (0 => estimator = S^2/D2 <= sum rho by Cauchy-Schwarz)
  radiation+dust: min estimator/true = 0.97959 at rho_m/rho_r = 1.333  (H low by 1.03%)
  dust + DE(w=-0.95), Om=0.31: estimator/true today = 0.381
  dust + DE(w=-0.90), Om=0.31: estimator/true today = 0.453
  dust + DE(w=-0.75), Om=0.31: estimator/true today = 0.659
  dust + DE(w=-0.50), Om=0.31: estimator/true today = 0.889
  dust + DE(w=+0.00), Om=0.31: estimator/true today = 1.000
  LCDM target via E-rule (start S = rho_m at z=999): (rho+p)_D today = 0.279 rho_c0, change in rho_D since z=999 = -6.887 rho_c0 (negative => needs rho_D,i >= 6.887 rho_c0 early)

## (e) phase-transition sizes (inputs RECALLED)
  rho_Lambda = 2.560e-47 GeV^4; Delta V_EW = m_H^2 v^2/8 = 1.182e+08 GeV^4 = 4.62e+54 rho_Lambda
  rho_r(T=160 GeV) = 2.302e+10 GeV^4; Delta/rho = 5.135e-03
  R-law kick: |Omega_K| at EW = 5.14e-03; grown to today |Omega_K0| = 7.58e+23 (DESI DR2 10^3 Omega_K = 2.3 +- 1.1)
  R-law closed-radiation freeze: a_max/a_T = sqrt(rho_r/Delta) = 14.0 -> T_freeze ~ 11.5 GeV
  A/U rules mistuned by Delta_EW: freeze (or Lambda-domination) when rho_r ~ Delta: T ~ 45 GeV; de Sitter branch H = 2.58e-15 GeV = 1/(2.55e-10 s)

